
## 5. Phase 3 — Interactive Cockpit (Event System)

### 5.1 Goals
Phase 1 gives the rig a *device-agnostic* hand. Phase 2 gives the hull a
*device-agnostic* command. Phase 3 must connect the hand to physical cockpit
parts — levers, buttons, toggles, dials — without leaking input APIs into the
controls and without leaking control types into the solver.

